# RUN: not %python %t.root/c/check_harness.py snapshots 2>&1 | %FileCheck %s

# CHECK: fixtures/secret-logging-checkpoint/fixed/secret_logging_checkpoint.fixed.mlir: fixture MLIR has no sibling snapshot.yaml
# CHECK: fixtures/alloca-size/high-count-unknown/snapshot.yaml: secret[0] argument index 99 is out of range
# CHECK: fixtures/alloca-size/public-control/snapshot.yaml: c_evidence[0] escapes its fixture family
# CHECK: fixtures/audience-mismatch/bad/snapshot.yaml: c_evidence[0] does not exist
# CHECK: fixtures/audience-mismatch/bad/snapshot.yaml: secret[0] name must match argument 0 ('logits')
# CHECK: fixtures/breach-compressed-length/bad/snapshot.yaml: cannot parse strict snapshot YAML: aliases, anchors, and explicit tags are not allowed
# CHECK: fixtures/breach-compressed-length/fixed/snapshot.yaml: cannot parse strict snapshot YAML: aliases, anchors, and explicit tags are not allowed
# CHECK: fixtures/clangover-poly-frommsg/source/snapshot.yaml: expect has an unknown value
# CHECK: fixtures/dynamic-kv-length/bad/snapshot.yaml: cannot parse strict snapshot YAML:
# CHECK: fixtures/dynamic-kv-length/fixed/snapshot.yaml: snapshot fields must contain exactly
# CHECK: fixtures/kyberslash1-poly-tomsg/bad/snapshot.yaml: a completed SPS state requires bitcode, manifest, and report
# CHECK: fixtures/kyberslash1-poly-tomsg/bad/snapshot.yaml: non-not-run SPS states remain disabled until the production verifier validates the report
# CHECK: fixtures/prefix-causal-release/bad/snapshot.yaml: snapshot fields must contain exactly
# CHECK: fixtures/redis-pool-reuse/bad/snapshot.yaml: snapshot must have exactly one sibling .mlir file
# CHECK: fixtures/redis-pool-reuse/fixed/snapshot.yaml: finding: violation requires expect: unknown
# CHECK: fixtures/redis-pool-reuse/fixed/snapshot.yaml: finding: violation requires a PREFLIGHT FINDING block
# CHECK: fixtures/secret-logging-checkpoint/bad/snapshot.yaml: public[0] argument 0 is not pointer-typed
# CHECK: fixtures/wolfssl-3579-mul/target-unknown/snapshot.yaml: format_id must be the literal 'SPS-Harness-Fixture-Snapshot-v2'
# CHECK: fixtures/wrong-party-plaintext/bad/wrong_party_plaintext.bad.mlir: preflight fixture forbids authoritative field '// model status:'
